---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service | Vyxqor" description="Terms of service for Vyxqor. Tool information is provided for decision-support purposes only.">
<div class="container" style="padding: 48px 0 80px; max-width: 720px;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Terms of Service</h1>
  <p style="color: var(--text-2); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 32px;">Last updated: August 13, 2026</p>

  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-2);">
    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">1. About Vyxqor</h2>
      <p>Vyxqor is an independent AI discovery and decision platform. We provide information, reviews, comparisons, and recommendations for AI tools, agents, and workflows. All content is for informational and decision-support purposes only.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">2. Not Professional Advice</h2>
      <p>Information on Vyxqor does not constitute professional, legal, financial, or medical advice. Always verify product details, pricing, and terms directly with the tool provider before making a purchase decision.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">3. Accuracy of Information</h2>
      <p>We make every effort to keep information accurate and up-to-date. However, AI product pricing, features, and availability change frequently. Product details on Vyxqor may not reflect the latest changes. Always check the official website for current information.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">4. Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>Vyxqor participates in affiliate marketing programs. When you click certain links and make a purchase, we may earn a commission. This does not affect the price you pay. See our <a href="/legal/affiliate-disclosure/" style="color: var(--accent);">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for full details.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>All product names, logos, and trademarks belong to their respective owners. Vyxqor is independent and not affiliated with any AI tool provider unless explicitly stated.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>Vyxqor is not liable for any damages arising from the use of information on this site. Use of AI tools and services is at your own risk. Always review the terms and privacy policies of third-party tools before use.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">7. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of Vyxqor constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px;">8. Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions about these terms: <a href="mailto:legal@vyxqor.com" style="color: var(--accent);">legal@vyxqor.com</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>